{"4832880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Selubra", "steam_appid": 4832880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5011740], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Depths of Selubra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/30ade174544bea9e12ba3754a56d48ec.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/30ade174544bea9e12ba3754a56d48ec.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/30ade174544bea9e12ba3754a56d48ec.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You wake up in a forgotten, dark subterranean world. This is not just a place where you must struggle to survive; it is a massive open world where you write your own fate. Whether you dive into perilous, dark dungeons, conquer the legendary Tower leading to freedom, or lay down your weapons to build your own peaceful (or eerie) life underground, the journey is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/588fcdf127a6bbffb934508cddf76e31.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/588fcdf127a6bbffb934508cddf76e31.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/588fcdf127a6bbffb934508cddf76e31.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Deep and Immersive Sandbox Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/f164009171ae089fa9d5938e20c83c1e.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/f164009171ae089fa9d5938e20c83c1e.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/f164009171ae089fa9d5938e20c83c1e.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Craft:</strong> Construct your own wooden home from scratch, set up crafting stations, and create a fortified sanctuary against the harsh underground conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Survival:</strong> Struggle against hunger, thirst, and the unforgiving nature of the underworld. It is not just the monsters—the environment itself is a constant threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG Mechanics:</strong> From woodcutting to athletics, mining to swordsmanship, develop and shape your character through every action you take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/bfc4d9976a1912016d0c9f2db2a0d7d3.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/bfc4d9976a1912016d0c9f2db2a0d7d3.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/bfc4d9976a1912016d0c9f2db2a0d7d3.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Different Destinies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/ac8e40b9dd5138e157f4bc5d0d655502.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/ac8e40b9dd5138e157f4bc5d0d655502.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/ac8e40b9dd5138e157f4bc5d0d655502.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Selubra does not force a single goal upon you. You choose your adventure based on your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery of the Depths:</strong> Dive deeper, clear dangerous dungeons, face terrifying bosses, and bring the secrets hidden in the heart of the darkness to light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascent of the Tower:</strong> Step into the legendary Tower, the only path to the surface. Can you complete this deadly climb where every floor holds different challenges and foes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Life:</strong> Perhaps returning to the surface is not that important. Forage, farm, expand your home, and live forever in the strange yet mesmerizing underworld of Selubra.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Depths of Selubra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/30ade174544bea9e12ba3754a56d48ec.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/30ade174544bea9e12ba3754a56d48ec.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/30ade174544bea9e12ba3754a56d48ec.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You wake up in a forgotten, dark subterranean world. This is not just a place where you must struggle to survive; it is a massive open world where you write your own fate. Whether you dive into perilous, dark dungeons, conquer the legendary Tower leading to freedom, or lay down your weapons to build your own peaceful (or eerie) life underground, the journey is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/588fcdf127a6bbffb934508cddf76e31.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/588fcdf127a6bbffb934508cddf76e31.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/588fcdf127a6bbffb934508cddf76e31.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Deep and Immersive Sandbox Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/f164009171ae089fa9d5938e20c83c1e.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/f164009171ae089fa9d5938e20c83c1e.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/f164009171ae089fa9d5938e20c83c1e.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Craft:</strong> Construct your own wooden home from scratch, set up crafting stations, and create a fortified sanctuary against the harsh underground conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Survival:</strong> Struggle against hunger, thirst, and the unforgiving nature of the underworld. It is not just the monsters—the environment itself is a constant threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG Mechanics:</strong> From woodcutting to athletics, mining to swordsmanship, develop and shape your character through every action you take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/bfc4d9976a1912016d0c9f2db2a0d7d3.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/bfc4d9976a1912016d0c9f2db2a0d7d3.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/bfc4d9976a1912016d0c9f2db2a0d7d3.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Different Destinies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/ac8e40b9dd5138e157f4bc5d0d655502.poster.avif?t=1785437230\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/ac8e40b9dd5138e157f4bc5d0d655502.webm?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/extras/ac8e40b9dd5138e157f4bc5d0d655502.mp4?t=1785437230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Selubra does not force a single goal upon you. You choose your adventure based on your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery of the Depths:</strong> Dive deeper, clear dangerous dungeons, face terrifying bosses, and bring the secrets hidden in the heart of the darkness to light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascent of the Tower:</strong> Step into the legendary Tower, the only path to the surface. Can you complete this deadly climb where every floor holds different challenges and foes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Life:</strong> Perhaps returning to the surface is not that important. Forage, farm, expand your home, and live forever in the strange yet mesmerizing underworld of Selubra.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Struggle for survival in the dark caves of Selubra. Shape your own destiny in this richly detailed 2D pixel-art open-world RPG: Descend into mysterious depths, climb the colossal tower to reach the surface, or build a whole new, endless life underground. The choice is yours.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/5e7fa73a5681f1d4ae3d0c73e78a1e2c850657a3/header.jpg?t=1785437230", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/1803d0f84bbee7494aa4d2e9684b67e2a647e35e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785437230", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832880/1803d0f84bbee7494aa4d2e9684b67e2a647e35e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785437230", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u